Subject: [PATCH] Add bounded snapshot V2 branch query kernel

Maintenance explanation added during mailbox export:
Introduce a snapshot-bound V2 branch query kernel with bounded pagination and tests for branch-oriented reads. The kernel defines a reusable query contract over authenticated index snapshots rather than an HTTP endpoint or live indexing integration.

